# One command, two lines, joined by a backslash

The other way a single command outruns a single line. Inside a fenced block the
line is the command, so the guard has to undo `\` continuation before judging —
otherwise the same evasion as `folded-inline-span` works with different bytes.

Measured as passing against the round-2 version of the #1905 check.
